## How to Run

Make sure Python is installed on your computer.

Clone the repository or download the Python file, then run:

```bash
python index.py
```

Follow the prompts in the terminal to play the game.

## What I Learned

This project helped me understand the fundamentals of Python by giving me a small, interactive program to build.

I practiced breaking a program into multiple functions, using loops to repeat actions, working with user input, and using conditional logic to control the game. It was one of my early steps toward understanding how programming logic works.

## Project Significance

This was a beginner project created in 2023 while I was independently learning Python. It was not intended to be a complete or professional gambling application. Its purpose was to help me experiment with Python concepts and understand how separate parts of a program work together.

